<ptxt>
<emph>
P2271: O2 Sensor Signal Biased / Stuck Rich (Bank1 Sensor2)
</emph>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Output voltage of HO2S-2 signal circuit is higher than 0.3 V for specified time after warming up even when vehicle is in fuel cut driving condition.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
(3 D/C detection logic)
</ptxt>
</entry>
